// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Commander_Channing 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 33 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Commander Channing 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3718769677" "Commander Channing"
// ProfessionString :
"P1085132046" "Military Commander"
// DescriptionString :
"P856364347" ""
// LocationString :
"P3297949105" "The Fringe"
// HelloString :
"P2654227060" "I don't have time to chew the fat, or didn't you happen to notice Hamidon's handiwork ripping through our men?  Now spit it out!"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1673012925" "You are out of line, soldier!  I will not tolerate jumping the chain of command in my units!  Report to your commanding officer, not to me, got it!?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P1984675893" "You've got to be kidding me.  You're the reinforcements?  Just you.  We are fighting a losing war out here and all they send me ONE person.  There's a whole battalion right over the hill there that Cole won't release every time I send a requisition, and instead he sends me you.  Does he even know what's going on out here?  Even though you alone won't be enough to win this war, I have to use everything I've got.  I'm Commander Channing, your new commanding officer, and I've got orders for you."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2597992534" "Hamidon looks like he's licking his wounds right now, so I've got no more black-ops missions for you right now.  Instead, get out there and kick some Devouring Earth butt!"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P4114616479" "I don't where you got the idea that I'm going to give you an assignment when you're lollygagging around with other people's people petty wants.  We've got a war going on out here, soldier!  Drop your other tasks then report back to me for more assignments!  Dismissed."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3051445687" "I don't know what you're doing out there in the field, soldier, but you need to get your act in gear ASAP!  I've got an assignment for you, but I need you at Security Level {Level}.  Once you start taking this war seriously and shape up, come for further orders!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2613100186" "So far you're shaping up, soldier.  I'm giving you my direct frequency so I can get orders to you much quicker."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1092701271" "Sorry I doubted you, soldier.  I guess Cole knew what he was doing when he sent you my way."
// WrongAllianceString :
"P1649414996" "I don't trust your motives, {HeroName}."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1667030216" "I'm unsure what we have to discuss."
// IntroString :
"P612594318" "There's someone I want you to meet.  Here is their contact information.  I think you would be inclined to work with them."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3751841202" "Meet New Contact"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2022483603" "This contact I've introduced you to can probably move you along down the path you've chosen."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2557049975" "I've got someone I think you should meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P799934329" "There's a couple of people you should talk to."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


