// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Dr_Aeon 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 33 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Dr. Aeon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1790874778" "Dr. Aeon"
// ProfessionString :
"P4103592858" "Frazzled Scientist"
// DescriptionString :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P874793614" "There is much science and so little time! Why do the mysteries of the universe tease me so?  Oh, you tricky little universe, you... oh, where was I?  Oh, yes.  SCIENCE!"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2202949577" "Some believe that science answers to no one.  I take great umbrage to that statement, for it does answer if you know the right questions.  You, however, haven't asked me the right question.  Thus, with the magic of logic, this would mean I, a disciple of science, does not answer to you.  Um... did I get that right?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P2137725143" "Yes, yes, yes, I'm Dr. Aeon.  And you are, um, you are.  Who were you again?  {HeroName}?  Oh, yes, I knew that.  {HeroName}. You have arrived at a most auspicious occasion, friend.  For, if my test results have been proven right, we are on the cusp of unlocking the secrets of the Devouring Earth!  All we need now is data.  And a control group.  And an experimental group.  Oh yes, a test plan.  We'll need one of those.  And, yes, actually testing.  Then the results.  But then... then is when we will unlock these secrets!  And you, my faithful assistant, will be right there with me!"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1881076996" "Patience, patience, patience!  One does not rush science, {HeroName}!  One must coax it like a lost youngling lamb looking for its' mother!  And that mother is me!  Well, I'm not its' mother, nor am I a sheep.  And science i not a lamb either.  But the analogy works all the same.  SCIENCE!"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1039881847" "Too, too many tasks!  I have so many beneficial experiments that must be carefully monitored, and it seems that you have as many tasks.  Perhaps when you are done with yours, I will still have need of you, trusty assistant!"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P755541375" "A saying amongst us in the Academia field is 'Would you ask a tenured professor to instruct a class of government bureaucrats?'.  Haha!  That one never gets old.  What's that?  Oh!  In layman's terms, this means that I won't be able to use you until you're Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P101921715" "{HeroName}, my friend, I believe I can entrust you with my own personal means of communication.  Here is my cell phone number if you wish to contact me by clairvoyant means."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3641849990" "You have performed admirably, {HeroName}.  I will be sure to include you in my article I'll be submitting to the Praetorian Science Journal."
// WrongAllianceString :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


