// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Genevieve Hill 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P398817649" "Genevieve Hill"
// ProfessionString :
"P4051280164" "Corporate Executive"
// DescriptionString :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P1474813693" "My father used to say that time was money.  If I am going to spend my time on you, please see to it that it's profitable."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2933615172" "I only speak with people by appointment only.  If you'd like to do business, I'll have one of my people get back to you."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2247866400" "My name is Genevieve Hill and I'm the President of Hill Imports and Exports.  Before you ask why someone of my station would be out here in the Fringe, let alone associating with known subversives, let me clearly explain that I answer to no one other than myself.  Therefore, do not waste my time or yours by asking.<br> <br>We may both be pursuing similar ventures, however.  I propose that we pool our resources and work towards our goals, as long as they overlap, that is.  Does this agreement sound acceptable to you?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P710344936" "I don't have anything on my schedule at the moment.  If something comes up, I'll be sure to get in contact with you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3266252431" "I have a business proposition for you, but unless you free up your schedule, I may have to contract this assignment to someone else."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2198273992" "My next assignment will require someone of at least Security Level {Level}.  I'd really like to do business with you, {HeroName}, but I can only hire the best."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2332311372" "I like the way you tackle problems, {HeroName}. I'd like to continue doing business with you in the future.  Call my direct number anytime."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P466546752" "My father used to tell me that I needed to lighten up.  Maybe he was right.  So... so thank you, {HeroName}.  I... okay, look... I appreciate your help.  Thank you."
// WrongAllianceString :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
