// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : James King 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3701895674" "James King"
// ProfessionString :
"P4032121587" "Survivor"
// DescriptionString :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P826394159" "Why are you staring at me?  You think I'm one of them, don't you?  Well, I'm not, okay?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P4194376492" "Have you come to point and laugh?  Come look at Crazy King, the crackpot?  Well, you'll see.  You'll all see one day.  Then you won't be laughing so hard, will you?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P15385693" "Did you ever think that maybe everything you know is a lie?  Well, I do, because I know it actually is.  I never know if the person I'm talking to is really them or some kind of pod-person, like in that old movie.  Yeah, I know you're thinking I'm a big crackpot, but that doesn't phase me since everyone does.  My name's James King.  The real James King, okay?  So did you want to talk or just point and laugh?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3657518963" "I haven't been able to detect any more of those pod-people.  I think we may have finally gotten them!"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P577286943" "You have too many things on your plate.  Come back when you're less busy."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P596860342" "I can't send you out a task right now until I know you're up to it.  This kind of mission is going to need you up at Security Level {Level}.  Come back when you're ready."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2028072502" "Wanna see more of what I'm talking about? Well here's my number if you want to hear more."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2025551813" "Now you see what I see, don't you {HeroName}.  I don't sound so crazy any more, do I?  You know, now we're in this together, right?"
// WrongAllianceString :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
