// Version     : 33 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Janet Anderson 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P788836552" "Janet Anderson"
// ProfessionString :
"P537887923" "Chomper"
// DescriptionString :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P2031568010" "Hey there, scraple dappler!  Are you hanging all cool style?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P112363229" "Hey, I don't talk to just anyone, you know?  I'm a bonafide chomper, got it?  So, why don't you go off and talk with one of your own friends?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P2220385489" "The name's Anderson.  Janet Anderson.  But, uh, all my friends call me Janey-Janey for short.  So are you a chomper, because I know I sure am!  Yup, out here chomping everything, like my friend Ricochet would say!<br> <br>So, hey!  Since you're a chomper and I'm a chomper, do you wanna do some, um, chomping things?  I've got some ideas in mind, and you might be able to offer a keen insight into... um, you know, things!"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2122220292" "I'm still investigating this odd string of, well, re-appearances.  So, um, maybe we can chomp another time.  Did I say that right?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3142406556" "I'm going to need your full attention, HeroName, before I ask for any more assistance.  So, um, do the chomping on those other tasks, then come back to me."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1653550408" "You're not chompy enough to help me out right now.  Come back when you're Security Level {Level}, okay?"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1905548306" "You've been a good deal of assistance recently, citiz - um, chomper!  Here is my personal number."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1365005652" "You've been more help than you could possibly imagine, {HeroName}."
// WrongAllianceString :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
