// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Master_Midnight 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 33 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Master Midnight 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1768114360" "Master Midnight"
// ProfessionString :
"P1829819729" "Master of Magic"
// DescriptionString :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P4179243113" "Dare you know the mysteries of the arcane, mere mortal?  What you see with your eyes are but a shadow of what lurks around you.  Beware."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1627818592" "I do not know you, mortal!  Do not bother me with your presence again unless there is a need that I have of you.  And you will know.  Oh, you will know."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2472415838" "You are in the presence of Master Midnight, the sole inheritor of the Midnight Squad's mystical powers.  With the strength of my will power alone, I could crush any mere mortal's mind.  Yea verily, I could crush every mind within all of Praetoria City.  But I will not today, for I am... um... feeling merciful.  Now that you are aware of my great power, choose your words carefully, simple one!"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3862090850" "There is nothing my almighty power can not withstand.  I no longer need your weak frame to assist in my endeavors!  Begone!"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P872702509" "You offer your services to me, but yet you have too many already?  You are lucky that I do not strike you down where you stand!"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3224897892" "You cannot comprehend the great mysteries that I will show you.  I have no use for a blind fool.  Come back to me when you have learned more about the truth of this world!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1449986897" "You are pleasing me.  Using my immense power, I shall now establish a direct connection between our minds!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3395041697" "You have served me well, mortal!  I shall now erase your true name from my book of secrets, thereby granting you your freedom.  You may praise me now."
// WrongAllianceString :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
